{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_cathy_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_cathy_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "日色温柔",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_cathy_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3d0c311a79824eb96306af2bf361c6448aa29c8afab528ba2f24e3369fe3a8cb",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "凯瑟琳......凯瑟琳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "克拉拉？你有事找我吗，这么早......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "唉，你肯定很忙吧？我就怕去你家里找不到你......你看，还好我来得早，不然真要扑空了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "忙什么，都退下来了。我只是去买这周的菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "你呢，你的互助会怎么样了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "嗯......就是为了那边的事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "凯瑟琳，我能不能，求你帮个忙呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我和你一起去杂货店吧？也不会耽误你很久......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "......好，正好你也帮我看看换什么牌子的清洁剂，之前我买的那种，擦水垢很费力。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "哎呀，你是不是还在用老汉克牌？他们换配方啦，价格是便宜了点，但效果和以前没得比......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "等会到店里再看吧。先说说你互助会的事？你需要我做什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "嗯......你也知道，我们互助会是帮单亲家庭带小孩子的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "本来只是大家凑在一起安排下时间，谁有连班或者夜班，就把小孩子送到有空的人家里待个半天一天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "这么多年都是这样过来的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "是有些年头了，难为你做到现在。以前我就佩服你能带那么多孩子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "唉，那时候我们家约翰多亏了互助会里的人帮忙。受了别人的恩惠，之后当然就该我帮别人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "只是战争结束之后，单亲家庭......一下子多了不少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "送来照看的小孩子也变多了，要还是像以前那样，谁的家里也挤不下呀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "别说让小孩子有地方写作业了，有的屋子里连椅子都不够坐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我们就商量着，是不是一起凑点钱，租个大小合适的、固定的地方。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "钱够吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "唉，毕竟人也变多了，大家各自出一点点，还是能凑出个差不多的数目......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "只是这个地方......本来是伊安和我一起在找......可我们，我们吵了一架。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "伊安已经四天没来互助会了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "算了吧，算了吧伊安......人家不租了，我们又能有什么法子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "再找找就是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "那个工厂老板太不讲理了！只是一间食堂库房而已，我仔细听了，他的工厂根本就没开工，怎么突然就“另有他用”了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "虽然租契还没签，但他明明都让我们付过定金了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "现在说不租就不租了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "唉......人家不是把定金退给我们了吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "我就是生这个气。他刚才把钱往你怀里一扔，一点歉意都没有，那瞧不起人的样子......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "明明是他毁约，不仅没个明白理由，连一句客气话都不肯讲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "咱们看着就那么好欺负吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "......你说，他是不是想涨价钱？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "不像吧？如果想涨价钱，他怎么不说呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "肯定是想等咱们先开口，讲价钱的时候，谁先开口谁就吃亏，都是这样的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "唉......你是不是特别想要这一处呀，伊安？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "我是呀。毕竟你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "唉，没什么。我是说，这里的位置、大小确实是最合适的，咱们一起花了那么多功夫才找到，好不容易谈下来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "可这是人家的地方，人家说了算......你就别不依不饶了，伊安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "克拉拉，你怎么老向着那家伙说话呢？我才是跟你一边的呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "你、你当然是，可你和我说这么多，我又有什么办法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "咱们两个老家伙，还拗得过人家大老板吗？你越说，我越是心烦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "好吧，对不起，克拉拉。是我让你烦恼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "咱们回头再见吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......直到今天，伊安都再没来互助会。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我......也后悔了，明明伊安是为我抱不平，我怎么对他说那样的话......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "是我太逆来顺受了......那个工厂老板毁约，我不敢说也不敢问，只一个劲唉声叹气，谁看了不生气呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "伊安有时也对我吞吞吐吐的。他是不是早就看不下去我这样了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我怎么就做不到像你一样呢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "......克拉拉，你不用像我。如果我能像你一样温柔，可能琳蒂就不会那么怨恨我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "至少她会好过一点。也许吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "你看，谁都会有想抱怨自己的时候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "凯瑟琳......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "好了。所以，你来找我，是想让我帮你解决这件事吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "没有没有，我只是想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "你能不能陪我再去找一次那个老板？就是......帮我撑撑腰什么的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "伊安说得对，如果那个家伙是想讲价，那、那也不是不能讲讲。有你在，那家伙至少不会太嚣张，或者胡乱开价什么的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "毕竟现在能在海布里区开厂子的人，没有不认识你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "要是能有个好结果，我也可以好好去和伊安道个歉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "那多出来的花销，你打算怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我......如果不算过分，我可以自己补贴一点......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "你觉得，这样能行吗？会不会耽误你的正事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我当然会帮你，克拉拉。别说什么“正事”不“正事”的，别把我当成什么战争英雄，我就是你认识的织不好毛衣的凯瑟琳，没变。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "先去看看情况吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......你怎么又来了？定金不是都退给你了吗，我可不欠你什么了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我......我想问问，如果我们愿意多出些租金呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "您看能不能，再考虑一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......我看着像是缺你那点租金吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "您想要什么价格，总归、总归可以谈一谈吧......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "你这老太太，怎么听不懂别人说话呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "不租了就是不租了。我看你年纪大，才对你客气，你这样就有点不识抬举了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "你管这样叫客气？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "怎么还有个老......等等，你是那个，那个战争英雄？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我是凯瑟琳·弗莱彻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......行吧。那你们想怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "先说好，我已经不打算重新开工了。没有工人让你们串联。你们又能拿我怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "说真的，这本来就是我的合法财产，我想怎么处置就怎么处置。我和她连租约都没有签，她根本就不是我的租客，哪条法律也管不着我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "我还给她退定金，已经够有良心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "先说说不打算重新开工是怎么回事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "哈，你不会要和我说什么工作岗位之类的话吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "我真是倒霉。在这个城市里，好心才是没有好报。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "听起来你也有麻烦。说不定我们能找到利益一致的地方，如果是那样，或许我也能帮到你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......你为什么要帮我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "如果帮你能对工人有好处，我为什么不帮你？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......好吧，看来你不是那种只会大喊大叫的铁疙瘩脑袋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "但不用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "如果你在意什么工作岗位的事，就之后来这里找哥伦比亚人吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "你把工厂卖给了哥伦比亚人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "不。不是工厂，只是厂房。这个工厂已经破产了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "你可能不知道吧，“战争英雄”，战争胜利并不意味着我这样的人就能拿到贷款。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "你能卖了厂房，就能抵押厂房，这些事我也懂一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......不，你不懂。那些哥伦比亚人不买我的厂房也会买别人的。以他们的价格，我和他们竞争，利润恐怕都不够付贷款利息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "我撑了两年......战争胜利的时候我还挺高兴，我以为我撑过来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "其实我还能再撑几个月......我本来是这么想的。但是哥伦比亚人来了，就没有这个必要了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......或者你觉得我能招到只拿一半工资的工人吗，“工人领袖”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "不能。议会不会允许。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "哈，还不是你们在议会里搞什么“最低工资法案”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "你破产了，还能卖了厂房拿一笔钱，回某个乡下别墅里舒舒服服地过活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "工人的工资减半对工人来说意味着什么，你明白吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "你可能不信，我其实明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "可能正是因为我明白这些事，我才会失败。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "或者你运气不好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "工人没有义务也没有能力给你的坏运气买单。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......我还是很讨厌和你们这些人说话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我不讨厌。你不算我见过最糟糕的家伙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我也希望这座城市里的人......能多交点好运。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我问过克拉拉你之前开的价钱，就像你说的，你确实不是为了租金才想把那间空库房租给她的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "......我当然也会想做点好事。老天允许的话。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "可惜老天对我的好意不如我自己的良心厚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "得了，我跟你们说这些干什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "工厂老板",
      "text": "总之，厂房我已经卖了。明白吗？别找我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "“我不是不想帮忙，是帮不上了”，你是这么想的吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "如果是这样，我有个提议，想听听吗？要是你愿意，你还是可以得到一些感谢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "数日后"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高个子工友",
      "text": "嘿！凯瑟琳，我这边搞定了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孬眼神工友",
      "text": "什么，你小子能比我快？不可能不可能——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高个子工友",
      "text": "哈，一杯啤酒都输不起？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "都辛苦了，等会儿我请客。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高个子工友",
      "text": "别！他输了就是输了，就算凯瑟琳请客，他也得欠我这一杯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我请我的，他欠他的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我请，我请。伯尼、加文，还有凯瑟琳，等会儿都上我家去，我来招待你们。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高个子工友",
      "text": "不就是建个活动板房嘛，一抬手的事儿，你跟我们客气啥，克拉拉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "孬眼神工友",
      "text": "就是，克拉拉，与其花钱给伯尼买啤酒，不如给孩子们买点吃的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "高个子工友",
      "text": "行啊，那把你欠我的酒也换成面包交给克拉拉，我没意见。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "那怎么行，你们都出了力气了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "克拉拉，他们两个今天是夜班，来不及去你家了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "哦......好吧，好吧，那就改天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "那凯瑟琳呢，你总有时间吧？这次全都是托你的福......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我哪里能想到那个工厂老板竟然是个好人......那天你们说话的时候，我连大气都不敢出。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "好人吗......算是吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "要在海布里区找一块空地，工厂外面是找不出来的，只有各个厂区的角角落落里还能有些零碎地皮。好在他只卖了厂房，没卖地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "那......等哥伦比亚人来了，我们不要紧吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "嗯，没事。那天过来时我就看到这里了，这么一角地方，又窄又偏，原本也就只能堆放点杂物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "之后我们再把那边的砖墙补一段，和厂区隔开，两边互不打扰。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "而且，这次租契都签好了，你还怕什么。现在的伦蒂尼姆，这点规矩总是可以有的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "还是你有办法，凯瑟琳，还得是你有办法......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我只是这一两天帮点忙，比不上你一直照顾孩子辛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我都这把年纪了，又没有什么本事......说是我照顾孩子，不如说是我怕寂寞，想要孩子们陪着我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "啊......我好像又说丧气话了，凯瑟琳，你不会不高兴吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我不会。我知道你就是这个性格，克拉拉。我心里觉得你了不起，不管你自己怎么说，我都是这么想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "出乎凯瑟琳的意料，克拉拉听到这句话，却像是想起了什么，瘪了瘪嘴巴，有点委屈的样子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "哦，你在想伊安。埋怨他和你生气？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......可能吧。他......有时候对着我，一副想说什么又不敢说的样子，他以为我看不出来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "你看得出他的心思，他当然也看得出你的。也许他有什么顾虑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......我总觉得他那天是想和我说什么，却又不肯说。结果一生气就是好几天，我也很委屈呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "虽然我说他让人心烦，确实是我不对......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "等把这里收拾干净了，我想请互助会的大家来聚一下......你说，伊安会来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "那你问我可没用，得问他才行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "聚会当日"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘气的孩子",
      "text": "哈！克拉拉，我可以在这里种东西吗？老师让我们观察种子发芽，看，这是我带来的豌豆和罐头空罐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沉着的孩子",
      "text": "你可别是想让罐头豌豆发芽吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘气的孩子",
      "text": "什么？我又不是傻子，这是我爸从杂货店买的新鲜豌豆！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "淘气的孩子",
      "text": "克拉拉克拉拉，我能种吗？可以吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "可以可以，那边堆了点砂土，你挖一点来种吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "这么多孩子，你一个人照顾？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "平时不会有这么多，今天是有聚会，才都来了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我也不是一个人，大家会轮流来帮忙的。我不像别人要去上工，时间多，就多照看一点。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "伊安也退休了，他会帮你吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "怎么，他没来吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......前天我上他家想和他说这件事，可他没在家......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我找对门的邻居帮忙留了口信......可......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "你说，他是不是躲着我呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "......克拉拉，你没考虑过和伊安商量商量吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "商量？你是说......商量什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "成个家，你们俩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "天啊！你在说什么呀凯瑟琳！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "当然，也不是一定要成家，但至少让他知道你喜欢他吧。别整天就你自己心里跌宕起伏的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "天啊凯瑟琳，我、我，你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "唉......你不会以为我看不出来吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......我这把年纪的人了，说什么喜欢......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "你闷着不说，又有什么好处？说了，又有什么损失？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "哪有这把年纪的人还谈这些的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "“这把年纪”又不是脑子不转了、心不跳了，你爱和他待一块儿，关心他的事，见不到他了就愁眉苦脸，这不是明摆着吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "别人肯定要嚼舌根......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "别人能说什么呢？你和伊安在互助会这些年，做了什么事，是什么样的人，大家都是看在眼里的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "照顾孩子是做好事呀。这件事可不一样，这多不知羞耻啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "啊，凯瑟琳，我不是说你说得不对。我就是......我是说我自己......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "说你自己“不知羞耻”吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我了解你，你从来都是真心待人，对伊安也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "真心怎么会羞耻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我也知道我们“已经这把年纪”了，但这只让我觉得......要做什么，就抓紧去做吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "我们剩的时间又有多少，还有什么可顾忌的呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "......可是，可是他现在还在生我的气，怎么办......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "伊安是什么性格，你还不知道吗？和你一样的老好人。他怎么会一直和你生气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "就算今天没......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "哦，来了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "呼......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "伊安，伊安！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "你......你来了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "怎么走这么急呀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "老巴迪今天早上才告诉我......！他还笑嘻嘻的，说什么“差点忘了，克拉拉又来找你了”......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "那老东西！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "我以为你还在生我的气......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "我......我那天是有点生气。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "我......唉，没什么。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "别“没什么”了。你总把话咽回去，克拉拉心里就打起鼓了。这几天她可没少难过。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "我，唉......我为什么特别希望互助会能在这里办，还不是因为......还不是因为，我想着，克拉拉是最经常照顾孩子们的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "另外看的几个地方，都离她的住处太远了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "要是以后孩子都上那些地方去，她每天得花多少时间来来回回？克拉拉腿脚不好，那么远的路，摔了碰了怎么办？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "我......我是担心她，却、却被说烦人......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "我有点儿伤心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "噢......伊安......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "对不起......伊安，对不起！你知道我总是说错话......我不是真的那么想......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "唉。我当然知道。第二天我就没生气了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "那你怎么不来互助会呀？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "......我在外面跑，这几天。我想多凑点钱，再去问问那个老板，能不能再商量一下......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "今天老巴迪和我说我才知道，你和凯瑟琳已经把事情解决了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "是不是凯瑟琳一出面，那家伙就不敢犯浑了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "那得看你觉得怎么样算犯浑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯瑟琳",
      "text": "哦，对了伊安，克拉拉好像有话和你说。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉&伊安",
      "text": "啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "克拉拉......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "克拉拉的手不自觉地揪着外套下摆。\n一晃神，凯瑟琳好像又看到了多年前的克拉拉。\n那一天，克拉拉也是这样紧紧地揪着白色纱裙的下摆，说出那三个字时还打了磕巴。\n眼前的克拉拉，脸上已满是皱纹了。可此时那张脸庞上的神情，与四十年前穿着白纱裙的少女又有什么两样。\n克拉拉张了张嘴，什么也没说出来。\n空气像是变得有点黏稠......然后，她听见了克拉拉的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "嗯......伊安。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "凯瑟琳刚才和我说......不对，也不是凯瑟琳让我干什么，是我自己想说......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "伊安，你说，咱们搭个伴......怎么样？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "......咱们......什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "克拉拉",
      "text": "你看，你不是总帮我吗？我觉得你很好......你觉得我怎么样呢？如果我和你......的话？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "克拉拉......天啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "我怎么能让你来说......唉，我、我一直......我知道，你肯定......肯定很介意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "天啊，克拉拉！我真没想到你会......你愿意......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊安",
      "text": "我当然、我当然觉得你很好！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他们不再说话，只紧紧地握住彼此的手。\n孩子们吵吵嚷嚷的声音传了过来，凯瑟琳转过头，朝那边看了看。\n今天是个阴天，但她觉得，天色似乎比一个小时前更明亮了。\n不过，这也是当然的，现在是早上。\n太阳还会升得越来越高的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
